        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK cotton on a 4 mm hook. Popcorn rows are worked on the wrong side so the domes face front. Total yarn needed is around 40 m because the folded domes use extra yarn."
          }
        ]
